      "notes": "tools/psdfixtures/verify_dump.py re-read the Agogo re-export with psd-tools 1.19.0; the file was accepted and reported the expected structure. ImageMagick was not installed in this environment, so this row rests on one independent reader rather than two. See testdata/VERIFICATION.md. The empty group survives the round trip as a group with no children."
